{"3894830": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Next In Line: Supermarket", "steam_appid": 3894830, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h1>Wishlist &amp; Play the demo first! ✨</h1><p><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3894830/extras/8c36319e98592dd930f14593b2f36f51.avif?t=1787721910\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3894830/extras_big/8c36319e98592dd930f14593b2f36f51.webp?t=1787721910 width=1560 height=460 /></span></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><strong>Next In Line</strong> is a cozy cashier and light supermarket management simulator where you work the checkout at a friendly neighborhood market.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🛒Scan. Restock. Bag. Smile. Repeat!</h2>Restock shelves before your shift, scan and bag groceries, and serve a stream of quirky customers while handling discounts, coupons, and the occasional chaos.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3894830/extras/577b7c72604ca1b6c6f16432a03d43bc.poster.avif?t=1787721910\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3894830/extras/577b7c72604ca1b6c6f16432a03d43bc.webm?t=1787721910\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3894830/extras/577b7c72604ca1b6c6f16432a03d43bc.mp4?t=1787721910\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🛒 Your Daily Shift, Your Cozy Routine</h2>  <br>Each morning starts with preparation. Organize incoming inventory, refill shelves, and get your store ready for the day ahead. Once customers start lining up, swipe barcodes, apply promos, print receipts, and handle payments with precision. Every action feels satisfying, from the beep of the scanner to the perfect grocery bag Tetris.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3894830/extras/a865a433805a9246efcdc11fc634f18a.poster.avif?t=1787721910\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3894830/extras/a865a433805a9246efcdc11fc634f18a.webm?t=1787721910\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3894830/extras/a865a433805a9246efcdc11fc634f18a.mp4?t=1787721910\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>📦 <strong>Restock the Store:</strong> Unpack daily deliveries, organize shelves, and prepare your supermarket before customers arrive.<br></li><li>🛒 <strong>Scan &amp; Bag:</strong> Place items on the scanner with satisfying mini-games, then fit them neatly into bags using limited space.<br></li><li>💸 <strong>Handle Payments:</strong> Accept cash or card, give exact change, or swipe cards just right.<br></li><li>🔍 <strong>Price Checks:</strong> Look up item prices, weigh produce, and print custom labels during busy shifts.<br></li><li>🏷️ <strong>Apply Discounts:</strong> Match valid coupons and take advantage of daily promotions.<br></li><li>🏃 <strong>Express Lane:</strong> Handle impatient customers with fewer items in a faster-paced checkout experience.<br></li><li>🛠️ <strong>Upgrade &amp; Customize:</strong> Expand your local mart with new sections, improve your checkout station, and unlock fun cosmetic extras.</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3894830/extras/49dbc7f35d5d9248626c2d3ce68e6716.poster.avif?t=1787721910\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3894830/extras/49dbc7f35d5d9248626c2d3ce68e6716.webm?t=1787721910\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3894830/extras/49dbc7f35d5d9248626c2d3ce68e6716.mp4?t=1787721910\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >✨ Cozy Vibes, Satisfying Flow</h2>  <br>Hand-drawn visuals, ambient supermarket sounds, and charming customer interactions make every shift feel relaxing and rewarding. Inspired by <i>Lost But Found</i>, but with a cashier and grocery store twist.<br><br><strong>Can you keep the shelves stocked and the line moving?</strong>  <br>Punch in and find out, there’s always someone <i>Next In Line</i>.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3894830/extras/8c36319e98592dd930f14593b2f36f51.avif?t=1787721910\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3894830/extras_big/8c36319e98592dd930f14593b2f36f51.webp?t=1787721910 width=1560 height=460 /></span><br><br><strong>💡 Wishlist now and be first in line for the free demo!</strong>", "about_the_game": "<strong>Next In Line</strong> is a cozy cashier and light supermarket management simulator where you work the checkout at a friendly neighborhood market.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🛒Scan. Restock. Bag. Smile. Repeat!</h2>Restock shelves before your shift, scan and bag groceries, and serve a stream of quirky customers while handling discounts, coupons, and the occasional chaos.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3894830/extras/577b7c72604ca1b6c6f16432a03d43bc.poster.avif?t=1787721910\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3894830/extras/577b7c72604ca1b6c6f16432a03d43bc.webm?t=1787721910\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.a